{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Bela son of Beor.</b> He is not Balaam. And Balaam is not a son of Laban the Aramean. It is possible that this is the way of derash, because he was a diviner like him, for the words of our Rabbis, of blessed memory, do not fall to the ground. And Balaam was an Aramean, while this Bela was an Edomite. Also Jobab son of Zerah is not Job, as the Yitzchaki the fool said."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:08.094021227Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}